course: dictionary
lesson: 13090
title: Money words
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Financial is a word about money. When you see it, you know the topic is money: how money is earned, spent, saved or managed. «The family needed financial help after the flood.» The family needed help with money, so financial means about money.
explain: Look at the words around it for clues. «The shop had serious financial problems and had to close.» Serious problems with money made the shop shut, so the clue is in the word problems and the idea of a shop closing.
explain: Financial is often used before another word, like «financial adviser», a person who gives advice about money. Check your meaning by swapping in money: "the family needed money help" still makes sense, so you have the right meaning.
fact: Financial means about money.
fact: «Financial help» means help with money.
fact: «Financial year» means the twelve months a business uses to count its money.
fact: Financial can also mean connected with banks, businesses and large sums of money.
fact: A good check is to swap in the word money and see if the sentence still makes sense.
exercise: «The family needed financial help after the flood.» What does financial mean here? | About feelings | About school lessons | About water and rain | *About money
exercise: What is a financial adviser? | A person who cooks food in a restaurant | A person who drives a bus | A person who looks after animals in a zoo | *A person who gives advice about money
exercise: Dad says the shop had «financial problems». What kind of problems were they? | Problems with reading | Problems with the weather | *Problems with money | Problems with a football match
test: Mia says her financial lessons are about baking cakes. What are they really about? | Baking cakes | *Money, such as saving and budgets | Animals on farms | Playing sports
test: Which word means about money? | Tall | Quiet | Happy | *Financial
exam: «The company's financial results were good this year.» What does financial mean here? | Sad | Loud | *About money | Wet
